WACA Tool (Wikipedia Article Creation Assistant)
A policy-enforcing, guided 6-step wizard to dramatically lower the entry barrier 
for new editors by preventing common submission errors (Notability, NPOV, Formatting) 
and ensuring every submitted draft is compliant with minimum Articles for Creation (AfC) standards.

Built for Toolforge: articleanalyzer.toolforge.org
Compliant with Wikipedia API policies and Toolforge terms of service.
